1
00:00:00,579 --> 00:00:03,829
(Penny:)...who's so annoying all the time,
and you totally are.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:08,633
(Penny:)But then it's like that movie Wall-E
at the end.

3
00:00:08,796 --> 00:00:12,466
(Penny:)You're so full of love
and you can save a plant...

4
00:00:12,633 --> 00:00:16,473
(Penny:)...and get fat people
out of the floaty chairs.

5
00:00:17,096 --> 00:00:21,646
That's a fairly labored metaphor,
but I appreciate the sentiment behind it.

6
00:00:22,851 --> 00:00:25,851
Sing "Soft Kitty" to me.

7
00:00:28,941 --> 00:00:31,731
"Soft Kitty" is for when you're sick.
You're not sick.

8
00:00:32,402 --> 00:00:35,902
(Penny:)Injured and drugged is a kind of sick.

9
00:00:44,665 --> 00:00:50,625
[SINGING] Soft kitty, warm kitty
Little ball of fur

10
00:00:50,796 --> 00:00:53,296
(Penny:)Wait, wait. Let's sing it as a round.

11
00:00:53,465 --> 00:00:55,005
(Penny:)I'll start.

12
00:00:57,594 --> 00:01:04,024
[SINGING] Soft kitty, warm kitty
Little ball of fur

